1|0@PS4^1439308321#ctz8tff:bobbytheman123$:How do I open it up like you've done in the picture?
1|0@PS4^1439320693#ctzhebf:ThroughTheDarkestDay$:Turn console over. There is four stickers marked with "warranty void if seal is broken" on them, remove those and the four screws under them using a T9 Torx bit. Lift up on the panel after removing screws to reveal the power supply and fan. The power supply had three more T9 screws and two phillips screws with small tabs attached. Remove those and gently lift the power supply straight up. BE CAREFUL AS IT IS STILL ATTACHED BY WIRES. Remove the wires attached below, if desired. I just left them on and cleaned around it. Reverse procedures to reassemble. 
