1|0@PS4^1439326434#ctzldf7:ACARDINAL86$:Mine was quiet and I still replaced the thermal paste and I'm glad I did. My thermal paste was hard and dried up. Those are qualities you don't wan't your thermal paste to have. Replaced mine with Arctic Silver 5 today. Took about 30 mins in all and I look at it as preventative maintenance. I did it with my PS3 as well a long time ago and haven't had any issues with heat/fan noise. To each their own. 
